        "citation": "DGS 008126787, item 1, frame 00005. Simona was born 19 April 1787 and baptized 27 May, daughter of Isidora Montañez with no father stated. The exact 1790 baptism naming Luís de Rivera and Isidora Rodríguez identifies the later bride, so this child is retained as a separate same-name person and not merged.",
